      "finding": "Structural influence is not reducible to usage: residual share 0.906, CI [0.768, 0.962]. The usage-residual is a reproducible player property (pooled-residual rho=+0.685, p=0.0000). Both fragility hypotheses confirmed, but low measurement reliability noted."
